# Line endings. The rule corpus and the conformance baselines are hashed byte for byte (the baselines' source_sha256),
# so a CRLF checkout (core.autocrlf on Windows) must never rewrite them: known issue S3.3-2-2 (owner, 2026-11-14).
*.cep text eol=lf
conformance/baseline/*.jsonl text eol=lf
# Kept exactly as committed: the comment-torture corpus file holds CRLF lines on purpose (its "crlf" construct).
docs/language/examples/torture/comments.cep -text
